Key design decisions:
- EvidenceRecord is immutable — no update/delete methods on EvidenceStore trait
- Lifecycle changes tracked via append-only EvidenceLifecycleEvent records
- native_artifacts stored as JSON array TEXT (no FK — opaque ID references)
- assumptions stored as JSON TEXT (Vec<Assumption> with optional self-referential evidence ID)
- EvidenceLifecycleState stored as string TEXT (human-readable: Active/Superseded/Invalidated/Unavailable)
- V7 migration (not V6 as plan suggested — V6 already used by aliases_native)
- EvidenceRecordId is distinct from M1 EvidenceId (both coexist)
